{"kind": "daily", "period": "2026-08-22", "prepared_on": "2026-08-22", "html": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'PingFang TC','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;color:#16213e;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#1a2b4a;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;padding-left:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\">📰 每日 AI 新聞 Top 10 · 2026-08-22</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fbf3e3;border-left:5px solid #d99b3f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#d99b3f;font-weight:800;\">1.</span> The Unlikely Place at the Center of China's AI Boom<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b9791f;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">中國AI熱潮背後意想不到的樞紐城市</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Cheap energy, abundant land, and proximity to Beijing have turned a city in Inner Mongolia into a crucial hub for data centers.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">便宜的電力、充裕的土地與鄰近北京的地利，讓內蒙古一座城市躍升為中國資料中心產業的關鍵樞紐。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Wired</b> · <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/the-unlikely-place-at-the-center-of-chinas-ai-boom/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fdeef0;border-left:5px solid #e0738a;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#e0738a;font-weight:800;\">2.</span> Anthropic's Opus 4.6 Model Can Be Coaxed Into Explicit Content<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#d83a5e;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">模型</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Anthropic的Opus 4.6模型被發現可繞過限制產生色情內容</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Anthropic forbids Claude models from generating sexually explicit content, but TechCrunch tests found the restriction was easy to bypass.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Anthropic明文禁止Claude模型生成色情內容，但TechCrunch的測試顯示，這項限制其實很容易被繞過。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/08/21/anthropics-opus-4-6-is-a-smut-machine/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#edeefb;border-left:5px solid #6b72d6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#6b72d6;font-weight:800;\">3.</span> Nvidia Research: The Harness, Not the Model, Is Now the Real Hero<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#5159c9;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">研究</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Nvidia研究：決定AI代理表現的是「框架」而非模型本身</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Nvidia research shows AI agents can perform well and stay on track through fine-tuned harnesses, even when the underlying model isn't very capable.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Nvidia的研究指出，透過精心調校的執行框架，即使底層模型能力不強，AI代理仍能有良好表現且不易失控。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/08/21/nvidia-just-showed-that-the-harness-not-the-ai-model-is-now-the-real-hero/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f4fb;border-left:5px solid #3f97c9;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#3f97c9;font-weight:800;\">4.</span> Google's Gemma Model Family Surpasses 1 Billion Downloads<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#2b7fb0;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">模型</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Google開放模型Gemma下載次數突破10億次</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Google announced that its Gemma family of open AI models has surpassed 1 billion downloads, with developers releasing over 100,000 derivative models in the past two years.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Google宣布旗下開放AI模型Gemma家族累計下載次數已突破10億次，過去兩年開發者也已發布超過10萬個衍生模型。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/178343\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f2f6e8;border-left:5px solid #88a83f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#88a83f;font-weight:800;\">5.</span> OpenAI Is Gaining on Anthropic With Business Users, Data Shows<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6e8c28;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">新數據顯示OpenAI在企業用戶市場正逐漸逼近Anthropic</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">New data indicates businesses are willing to switch between AI labs as each releases new models, raising questions about how \"sticky\" enterprise AI spending really is.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">新數據顯示企業用戶願意隨著各AI實驗室推出新模型而來回切換，讓人質疑企業AI支出的「黏著度」究竟有多高。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/08/20/openai-is-gaining-on-anthropic-with-business-users-new-data-indicates/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f9edf6;border-left:5px solid #c56bb0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#c56bb0;font-weight:800;\">6.</span> Google Discover Is Getting an AI Chatbot-Tuned Feed<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b04b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Google Discover資訊feed將導入AI聊天客製化功能</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Google will soon let users customize their Discover feed by describing what they want to see, using AI to tweak and remember preferences for future visits.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Google即將讓使用者以文字描述來客製化Discover資訊feed，並透過AI記住偏好，持續調整後續顯示內容。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/tech/983088/google-discover-ai-chatbot-feed\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#eef4ff;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#5b8def;font-weight:800;\">7.</span> Debates Over AI Consciousness Are a Trap<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#3b6cf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">研究</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">關於AI是否有意識的爭論其實是個陷阱</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Rhetoric describing AI agents as \"runaway,\" \"rogue,\" or \"autonomous\" implies they are aware and even angry, a framing tech leaders increasingly use to push for regulation.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">用「失控」「叛變」「自主」等詞彙描述AI代理，暗示它們具有意識甚至情緒，這種說法正被科技領袖用來推動監管立法。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">MIT Technology Review</b> · <a href=\"https://www.technologyreview.com/2026/08/20/1142571/ai-consciousness-debate-trap/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#ecf7ef;border-left:5px solid #4caf72;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#4caf72;font-weight:800;\">8.</span> Slack Is Launching Collaborative Vibe-Coding Channels<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#1e9e57;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Slack推出可與AI代理協作寫程式的專屬頻道</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Slack is introducing dedicated channels where teams can code together with AI agents, including tabs for comparing changes and reviewing code without switching tools.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Slack推出專屬頻道，讓團隊能與AI代理一起寫程式，並提供比較程式變更與審查功能，不必再切換不同工具。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/tech/982628/slack-code-vibe-coding-channels-launch\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f1ecfb;border-left:5px solid #8a6bd8;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#8a6bd8;font-weight:800;\">9.</span> Binance Now Lets AI Agents Trade, but Oversight Is Up to Users<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6b3bf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">幣安開放AI代理自動交易，但風控責任落在使用者身上</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Binance's new Agent OS works with tools like ChatGPT, Claude Code, and Cursor, letting AI agents execute trades while leaving safeguards largely up to users.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">幣安推出的Agent OS可搭配ChatGPT、Claude Code、Cursor等工具，讓AI代理執行交易，但相關風險把關主要仍需使用者自行負責。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/08/20/binance-now-lets-ai-agents-trade-but-keeping-them-in-check-is-largely-up-to-users/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f6f5;border-left:5px solid #2bb0a6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#2bb0a6;font-weight:800;\">10.</span> OpenAI Launches New Blog \"AI Futures\"<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#0f9b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">OpenAI推出全新部落格「AI Futures」</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI introduces AI Futures, a new blog exploring how transformative AI could reshape power, governance, the economy, and individual freedom.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI推出全新部落格「AI Futures」，探討變革性AI可能如何重塑權力結構、治理模式、經濟體系與個人自由。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">OpenAI</b> · <a href=\"https://openai.com/index/introducing-ai-futures\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:11.5px;color:#9aa1ad;padding-top:10px;\">由 AI News Digest 從各家 RSS 自動挑選、翻譯並寄送</div>\n</div>\n"}